 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored. Group 0: panel 6 (Hoofdweg W, 87.8 m) from w01-252L 2021-03-29 (leafless) checked against w01-252 2022-04-29: 46 window axes, shops at the ground, glass boxes on storeys 1, 3 and 5 staggered (three, four and four runs), white fin crown on storey 6. Group 1: panel 29 (Elckerlijcstraat E, 87.2 m) from w02-72 2021-03-26: 46 axes, brick residential ground, glass boxes on storeys 1 and 3, fin crown on storey 4.",
  "Group 2: panel 0 surface 1 (Erasmusgracht S end of the W wing, 11.5 m) from w04-162 2020-05-11: brick frame round a pale-panelled glazed grid of four axes, fins at the top left, a ribbon window at the ground. Group 3: surface 25 (the 4.4 m link) from w04-162: brick with a ribbon window and the car-park entrance. Group 4: panel 28 (S end of the E wing, 11.7 m) from w05-162L 2019-12-10: a pale-panelled glazed grid of four axes. The N end (panel 30) has no crop and the courtyard (pale panel fronts seen obliquely in w04-162) takes otherWalls window-grid.",
  "Glass boxes are ribbonStoreys behind balconyBands spans (the floor slab with its glass rail, and the next storey's span as the box roof); the photo's boxes are closed glazed volumes about 1.5 m proud with returns, which the kit cannot draw as one component on several spans per storey."
 ],
 "closedBands": true,
 "shellRepair": true,
 "budgetTriangles": 30000,
 "footprintParts": true
